**public** **static** **class** SubThread **extends** Thread**{**} 
```

```java
@Override
**public** **void** run () {
    working () ;
}
**private** **void** working () {
    System . *out* . println (“sub thread start working.”) ;
    busy () ;
    System . *out* . println (“sub thread stop working.”) ;
}
